WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.789 --> 00:00:01.789
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.789 --> 00:00:06.660
I'm Emil from Pongfinity and today - as you
might see - we are doing some Christmas trick

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.300
shots!

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.580
Hope you enjoy!

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.710
First of all, Christmas is nothing without
a Christmas tree.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.220
And a Christmas tree is nothing without some
decorations.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.120
So, let's decorate the tree!

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.940
Let's start with some table tennis rubbers.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.960
I have 10 rubbers here and let's see how many
will stay on the tree when I throw them.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.240
Okay, that's pretty good!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.920
Looks like I got 9 out of 10.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.600
Now let's just finish off with some table
tennis balls.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.320
Ok, so the Christmas tree is now decorated.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:47.240
It looks pretty nice I think.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.120
Let's take a closer look at it.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:14.569
Next we need to light up the Christmas candles.

00:02:14.569 --> 00:02:20.060
And to make this process a bit more interesting,
let's light the match with a table tennis

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:21.380
shot.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.180
And then light the candles.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:18.760
Ginger cookies are really good, but how many
of them is it possible to crush with 1 table

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.049
tennis shot?

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:23.200
I think the right answer is maybe 3, but let's
find that out now.

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.680
Okay this is creating such a mess on the floor
so it's better to stop here.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:33.470
But apparently it's possible to hit even more
than 5, so maybe I'll try it out sometime

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.400
in the future.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.880
You know, this Christmas elf looks like it
would like to play some table tennis.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.380
So let's make that happen!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:17.480
Always when you're lighting candles, you have
to remember to put them out.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.590
So you can probably guess what I'm going to
do next.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.590
But.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:24.000
I'm going to do it with 2 consecutive shots.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.670
Hope you guys enjoyed this video, it was a
lot of fun making it.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:08.570
If you want to see more videos please leave
this video a thumbs up and if you are new

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:13.390
to the channel subscribe right here and watch
the previous episodes here.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.200
Happy Holidays!

